## Payment Requests

### Create a payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "date": "2026-10-05",
  "amount": 45000.00
}

> {%
    client.global.set("paymentId", response.body.id);
%}

### Get a payment by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/{{paymentId}}

### List payments by student
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments?studentId={{studentId}}

### List payments by student with date range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments?studentId={{studentId}}&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### Update payment (correction)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/payments/{{paymentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "date": "2026-10-06",
  "amount": 47000.00
}